{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e01-scene-06",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "自由をはき違えるなよ  (Don't Mistake What Freedom Means)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "takei": "武井"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Spotting Muranishi campaigning for parliament, detective Takei strolls into the crowd, agrees to hold off on handcuffs until Kuroki finishes her speech, and warns Muranishi not to confuse lawlessness with freedom.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "今度は選挙に出馬かい。村西君ってホント面白えよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この村西とおるに国会で何をしてほしいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さんの意見をお聞かせください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お見事でございます。すばらしい提案ではございませんか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "手錠はあとにしてもらえますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いいよ別に。支援者のふりしてやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "罪状は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "児童福祉法違反だ。お前のビデオに未成年が出てんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "理不尽に縛られることない自由な社会を目指しましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ご清聴ありがとうございました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし帰るぞ、みんな早く乗れ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "村西、自由をはき違えるなよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "今度は選挙に出馬かい。村西君ってホント面白えよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Running in an election this time? Muranishi really is hilarious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この村西とおるに国会で何をしてほしいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What would all of you like Toru Muranishi to do in parliament?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さんの意見をお聞かせください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please let me hear your opinions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お見事でございます。すばらしい提案ではございませんか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Splendid! Isn't that a magnificent proposal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "手錠はあとにしてもらえますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you hold off on putting the handcuffs on until afterward?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いいよ別に。支援者のふりしてやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure, fine by me. I will pretend to be one of your supporters.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "罪状は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the charge?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "児童福祉法違反だ。お前のビデオに未成年が出てんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Violation of the Child Welfare Act. A minor appeared in your video.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "理不尽に縛られることない自由な社会を目指しましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us aim for a free society unbound by unreasonable rules.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ご清聴ありがとうございました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all very much for listening.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし帰るぞ、みんな早く乗れ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, time to head back—everyone get in the van quickly!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "村西、自由をはき違えるなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Muranishi, don't get the wrong idea about what freedom means.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
